[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/celery/celery/issues/comments/53970843","html_url":"https://github.com/celery/celery/issues/2225#issuecomment-53970843","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/celery/celery/issues/2225","id":53970843,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDUzOTcwODQz","user":{"login":"aneilbaboo","id":2592723,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1OTI3MjM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2592723?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aneilbaboo","html_url":"https://github.com/aneilbaboo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aneilbaboo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aneilbaboo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aneilbaboo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aneilbaboo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aneilbaboo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aneilbaboo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aneilbaboo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aneilbaboo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aneilbaboo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2014-08-30T21:19:27Z","updated_at":"2014-08-30T21:19:27Z","body":"I traced the hang to a line in `on_chord_part_return`:\n\n``` python\ngid = task.request.group\n```\n\nresults in `gid = None`.  Changing the line to \n\n``` python\ngid = task.request.taskset\n```\n\nfixes the problem, but several tests now fail.  \n\nHere's a patch with my changes.  \n\n``` python\nFrom d968f8524719fcc46c85ff31a7972ab065fb2499 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001\nFrom: Aneil Mallavarapu <aneil.mallavar@gmail.com>\nDate: Sat, 30 Aug 2014 13:32:01 -0700\nSubject: [PATCH] Fix issue #2225\n\nCreating a chord no longer results in \"TypeError: group object got\nmultiple values for keyword argument 'task_id'\", however, several\ntests now fail.\n---\n celery/backends/base.py | 8 ++++++--\n 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)\n\ndiff --git a/celery/backends/base.py b/celery/backends/base.py\nindex 1dd5ff1..8163eb8 100644\n--- a/celery/backends/base.py\n+++ b/celery/backends/base.py\n@@ -519,7 +519,11 @@ class KeyValueStoreBackend(BaseBackend):\n     def _apply_chord_incr(self, header, partial_args, group_id, body,\n                           result=None, options={}, **kwargs):\n         self.save_group(group_id, self.app.GroupResult(group_id, result))\n-        return header(*partial_args, task_id=group_id, **options or {})\n+\n+        fixed_options = dict((k,v) for k,v in options.items() if k != 'task_id')\n+\n+        return header(*partial_args, task_id=group_id, **fixed_options or {})\n+\n\n     def on_chord_part_return(self, task, state, result, propagate=None):\n         if not self.implements_incr:\n@@ -527,7 +531,7 @@ class KeyValueStoreBackend(BaseBackend):\n         app = self.app\n         if propagate is None:\n             propagate = app.conf.CELERY_CHORD_PROPAGATES\n-        gid = task.request.group\n+        gid = task.request.taskset\n         if not gid:\n             return\n         key = self.get_key_for_chord(gid)\n-- \n1.8.4.2\n```\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/celery/celery/issues/comments/53970843/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"aneilbaboo","id":2592723,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1OTI3MjM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2592723?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aneilbaboo","html_url":"https://github.com/aneilbaboo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aneilbaboo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aneilbaboo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aneilbaboo/gists{/gist_id}","starr