pos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aarcro/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aarcro/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aarcro/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2015-07-10T20:10:06Z","updated_at":"2015-07-10T20:10:06Z","body":"I think I'm seeing this too. My chord with two tasks in the header raises this twice:\n\n```\n[2015-07-10 20:03:25,658: ERROR/ForkPoolWorker-1] Chord callback '3d0dd6ef-b966-40a5-9aff-213a9e38d8bc' raised: ValueError('3d0dd6ef-b966-40a5-9aff-213a9e38d8bc',)\n```\n\nWhich happens because around line 550 in celery/backends/base.py, there are no deps returned.\n\n```\n547             gid = task.request.group\n548  ->         if not gid:\n549                 return\n550             key = self.get_key_for_chord(gid)\n551             try:\n552                 deps = GroupResult.restore(gid, backend=task.backend)\n553             except Exception as exc:\n```\n\nI'm throwing darts, so while I was in the debugger I tried to get GroupResults for the corollation ID, but that failed as well. So I think either that `task.request.group` value needs to be different, or something needs to have gotten in to the backed (redis for me) before we get to this code.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/celery/celery/issues/comments/120510153/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"aarcro","id":279725,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3OTcyNQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/279725?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aarcro","html_url":"https://github.com/aarcro","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aarcro/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aarcro/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.githu